        "name": "Eclipse",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Leona raises her shield to gain Damage Reduction, Armor, and Magic Resist. When the duration first ends, if there are nearby enemies, she will deal magic damage to them and prolong the duration of the effect.",
        "bodyHtml": "Leona raises her shield, reducing incoming damage by 8/12/16/20/24 and gaining <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">(20/27.5/35/42.5/50 + ([[si:scalearmor]]20% bonus Armor)) Armor</span> and <span>(20/27.5/35/42.5/50 + ([[si:scalemr]]20% bonus Magic Resist)) Magic Resist</span> for 3 seconds. Afterwards, her shield detonates, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(55/85/115/145/175 + ([[si:scaleap]]40% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> to nearby enemies. If she hits at least one, she retains the <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">Armor</span> and <span>Magic Resist</span> bonuses for an additional 3 seconds.<br /><br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Damage reduction effect can't reduce the damage below 50%.</span>",
